

PROJECT TITLE
LEGALEASE – AI-POWERED LEGAL DOCUMENT GENERATOR

1. PROBLEM IDENTIFICATION

Creating legal documents manually can be time-consuming and difficult for users who are not familiar with legal formats and terminology.

2. IDEA

LegalEase is an AI-powered platform designed to simplify the creation of customizable, accurate and editable legal documents.

3. TARGET USERS

• Startup founders
• Freelancers
• Landlords

4. KEY USE CASES

• Employment contracts
• Non-Disclosure Agreements (NDA)
• Residential lease agreements

5. PROPOSED SOLUTION

The user provides the required details, and the system uses Generative AI to generate a structured legal document based on the given information.

6. EXPECTED BENEFITS

• Saves time
• Provides structured legal documents
• Allows customization and editing
• Supports document export in different formats

7. PROJECT GOAL

To bridge the gap between accessibility and professional legal document creation using AI technology.
